  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MoH via BTC kapacitetsbyggande 2011-15</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MoH via BTC management capacity building 2011-15 - MoH via BTC management capacity building 2011-12</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till planering, ledarskap och styrning av centrala               h&#xe4;lsoministeriet samt tv&#xe5; regionsjukhus i Fort Portal och Arua.       Syfter &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka deras kapacitet att ge b&#xe4;ttre handledning och st&#xf6;d  till v&#xe5;rdmottagningar p&#xe5; l&#xe4;gre niv&#xe5;. Projektets finansiering g&#xe5;r via  Belgiens motsvarighet till Sida - BTC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Planning, Leadership and Management capacities at central  Ministry of Health but also regional referral hospitals in Fort       Portal and Arua in order to enhance improved supervision from the     hospitals to the lower health facilities. Project funding channelled  through Belgian Development Agency, BTC.</narrative>
  </description>
